# Autodeploy to Cloudflare

After a change that affects the live practice app (UI, theory, audio, settings — not docs-only), deploy without being asked:

1. Commit and push to `main`.
2. GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`) publishes to Cloudflare using the repo secret **`CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN`**.

Live URL: https://jazz-tone-drill.pages.dev

Tell the user that URL when deploy finishes. Do not start a long-running dev server unless they ask. Docs-only or plan-only edits do not need a deploy.

Remote deploy setup for all sites (BitBard, explore.bitbard.io, michaelwitmore.com): see [docs/cloudflare-remote-deploy.md](../../docs/cloudflare-remote-deploy.md).
